WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.057
Notes keeps quick ideas and reminders in your pod, ready to pick up later.

2
00:00:06.168 --> 00:00:10.215
Give a note a title, add a few words, and close it.

3
00:00:10.215 --> 00:00:12.437
Your note appears as a card.

4
00:00:14.517 --> 00:00:16.520
Pin it to keep it near the top.

5
00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:19.428
Reload the page, and the note is still there.
